t(1, 960, """When hearts turn white, the roads turn white .. And in snow there are many benefits. May Allah grant this whole land a winter of snow, make the warmth of homes the hearts of their families and dwellers, and make the snow a shepherd's staff that brings the flock into the homes early, so there is no staying up late outside the home, and more closeness around the stove, and an early, pleasant sleep""")

t(1, 2500, """A rain that does not cease, by the power of Allah the Exalted .. Get ready soon, by the power of Allah the Exalted, for crops and fertile pastures, outward and inward security, a life without hardship and freedom of travel""")

t(3, 1842, """When women are at certain times unable to enter the mosque, women's halls are a suitable alternative and a solution to that problem, for they are not mosques. A woman who cannot touch the Mushaf can join a recitation circle and recite from what she has memorised or listen to what is recited. And if iPad technology or a phone with the Mushaf stored on it, with no need for the internet, is available, it is possible to read from them, because they do not take the ruling of the paper Mushaf; the writing in them is fluctuating pulses, not fixed printed writing. What matters is that these not be halls in which the prayers are held, otherwise they take the ruling of the mosque .. They can be lecture halls only.""")

t(4, 2473, """{So be patient with a beautiful patience * They see it as far off * But We see it as near}""")

t(5, 1431, """{And whoever relies on Allah, He is sufficient for him. Allah will surely accomplish His purpose. Allah has set a measure for everything}""")

t(6, 377, """{Those who were driven out of their homes without right, only because they said: “Our Lord is Allah.” Had Allah not repelled some people by means of others, monasteries, churches, synagogues and mosques in which the name of Allah is much remembered would have been demolished. Allah will surely help those who help Him. Allah is truly Strong, Almighty}""")

t(6, 1886, """Redefining North Africa, Sudan, Yemen, Iraq and Sham!""")

t(7, 837, """Redefinition""")

t(7, 2296, """Men are a provision greater than wealth! Whoever is aware understands, and whoever understands manages this provision well! And great states grasp that very well""")

t(10, 1910, """The new weddings, Allah willing .. No alleys and lanes full of what does not befit a human being, and no celebrations that do not befit our Ummah and its religion - a statement not related to a particular country""")

t(11, 909, """The time has come for the exhausted, whom the noisy cities have worn out, kept on edge 24 hours a day and made anxious all the time because of the pressure of those huge great cities, the time has come for them, by Allah the Exalted's leave, to live the life of Europe! No noise and no tension! Calm .. a clean environment .. natural human movement .. So the souls of the dwellers of the cities of millions calm down, the exhausted and the weary, those who no longer feel their humanity at all and only feel that they are running in a jungle around the clock; the time has come for them, by the power of Allah the Exalted, for their lives to be set right and to live the life of real human beings""")

t(12, 101, """Farewell, by the power of Allah the Exalted, to the crowding of Egyptians in the Fustat of Amr ibn al-As and their crowding in the Cairo of the Fatimids! There will no longer be a need, Allah willing, for them to live in inhuman conditions under the weight of the overpowering need to live in residential clusters unfit for human habitation, the need that pursues them to dwell in neighbourhoods that offer them nothing but a hard, miserable and painful life!""")

t(12, 1699, """Who remembers IPet Goat II ? In this film the river Nile was at the pyramids and Egypt was completely submerged in water .. That is their aim .. to drown it in order to wipe out its people .. The truth is that bringing the river Nile to many places is very important, so that by the decree of Allah the Exalted it may be a cause of bringing life to new Egyptian cities .. especially after the Ethiopian danger over the river ends completely in the future. What was in IPet Goat II, which was produced perhaps 15 years ago in Canada, is not a wish to bring the river Nile to the desert of Egypt as every Muslim and every human being hopes, but a wish to drown Egypt and wipe it out .. So this is their prophecy about Egypt; let them keep it to themselves .. The river Nile reaching the desert of Egypt is, for me, not a prophecy but a reading and an understanding, because here I am presenting merely a view and an understanding. As for the decrees, they come to pass only when Allah the Exalted wills them to come to pass at the hands of those whom Allah the Exalted wills to be a cause of their coming to pass!""")

t(13, 1079, """Man has made clothing in shapes, kinds and colours, and custom is not religion in everything! Some custom agrees with the religion, and some of it does not bind people if they wear what agrees with the Shariah, even if it differs from the prevailing custom in fabric, colour and shape. And covering clothes that do not reveal the body come in twenty-one kinds. The principle is not a particular shape or a particular fabric; the principle is that the clothing meets the correct conditions of Shariah dress, and on this and by this the reality of the correct Shariah dress for women in the Muslim society is understood.""")

t(14, 269, """A century ago in people's time, in the streets of our region, stretching across the Arab, Turkish and Persian lands, you would hardly see a single man in the street without a coat, a jilbab or a jacket! Public manners were present in people's lives.""")

t(14, 1773, """General words .. General words only for the general benefit; for me before they are addressed to any Muslim

Everything has a proof and an evidence. Whoever says “I saw with my heart something of the Essence of Allah the Almighty”: either there is proof or there is no proof

And the proof is that you be equal to what was witnessed. Is it like witnessing existing things, when you witnessed with your heart something of the Essence of al-Wajid?! No, far from it

So every feeling has a proof of certainty, even if it comes by degrees; that does not matter. What matters is: did it happen at all, or is illusion what happened? If you saw something of the Essence of Allah in your heart, meaning you understood something about the Essence of Allah, then set what happened against what occurs and comes from you every day. If what occurs and comes from you every day follows and submits to that vision of the heart of something of the Essence of the King, then you did indeed see. And if it does not follow that vision of the heart of something of the Essence of the King, then what you imagined did not happen. This is a firm measure for whoever has felt and wants the evidence of his heart, which is above the proof of his mind and his tongue

And know that if you did indeed see, your life does not go back .. does not ever go back, and never returns to how it was before it happened and you saw. The light does not vanish, the darkness does not descend, the resolve is not broken, the devil has fled and run away, the King is company and companionship, and the whole world has perished and its resurrection has come. If that is your state, then you did indeed see; and if this is not your state, then you imagined the vision""")

t(15, 140, """And know that the one who has seen will not seek worldly gain in it, not even a broken, rusty dirham. What saddens most people does not sadden him, and what gladdens most people does not gladden him""")

t(15, 535, """Guevara wanted to launch a thousand revolutions! The truth is that there is an alternative when there is no need for revolution! It is to launch a thousand cities! Then there will be no need for any revolution! Then the thousand revolutions will already have taken place and achieved all their aims! The person who has the drive to launch a thousand revolutions and a thousand fires in which millions of people fall and die is the very person who ought to have the drive to launch a thousand cities in which millions of people live and thrive!""")

t(18, 1912, """Destiny is not killed. Destiny is the command of the Almighty Lord. Destiny does not change. Destiny occurs and comes to pass. And if a wretch wants to stop it, he is between his heart stopping, his soul being terrified or the flesh of his face falling off! Destiny is a judgement over things and over creatures, those we know and those we do not know! To Allah alone belongs the judgement over everything. Destiny is a challenge to every power on earth! Destiny is victory over every human opposition. Destiny is a bullet that never misses! Destiny is a shot that is never like the shot of humans! Destiny is fire without its cause and ice without its cause! Destiny is the fall of that whose fall human minds cannot imagine, and the rise of that whose rise human minds cannot imagine! Destiny is a promise, and the promise is not broken or gone against! Destiny is certain and inevitable! Destiny is a correct address, and killing a thousand wrong addresses does not remove the correct address! Could Iblis have killed Adam and quenched his rage on him?! Or could Pharaoh have drowned the prophet of Allah Musa and his people?! Or could the disbelievers of Quraysh have killed the destiny and mercy of mankind?! ﷺ?! They could have killed a thousand men they took for Muhammad ﷺ, but the Prophet ﷺ would never have been one of those killed! Pharaoh could have imagined that he was chasing strangers other than the prophet of Allah Musa and his people! But the prophet of Allah Musa and his people were certain to be saved in every case! All power belongs to Allah; whoever grasps this is safe, and whoever doubts grows weary and terrified!""")

t(19, 1694, """It will turn green only when the time comes""")

t(20, 646, """As our Prophet ﷺ gave glad tidings .. this colour will come to be in all of our region, by the power of Allah the Exalted""")

t(20, 2103, """How is a person tried in his own self, and how might vanity strike him from the works of the spirit, not from the works of this world .. wealth .. standing .. power?!

In the dominion of Allah our Almighty Lord there are wonders that never end! The journey of this channel was not only what appeared of it and what was visible in its posts; there is a hidden side known to a few people who witnessed something that not everyone witnessed! On this channel we all got to know one another and met, and the meeting with everyone was not one and the same or of one kind! There was a second, different kind of communication! A kind that the mind cannot believe when it witnesses it in itself! Perhaps not much remains of the lifetime of the network worldwide, so let the reward be for the smile .. Among the wonders that bring a smile is what brothers and sisters wrote when they got in touch over these years .. True, they are few and not a huge, great number, but the number is not what matters here .. Some of them got in touch and asked: Are you sad? Some got in touch and asked: Are you hungry? And some got in touch and asked: Are you exhausted and tired?""")

t(21, 74, """And some got in touch and asked about states I do not remember! Some of them got in touch after a crisis and said: We felt that you were in a crisis, but we did not know what was happening to you! And every one of these brothers and sisters was right in his question. I have often witnessed a strong state of spiritual connection between me and people thousands of miles away .. and half a metre and less away in the streets and shops .. Today at the Friday prayer something also happened whose sharing brings a smile .. The preacher began the supplication and we began saying amen, and two men passed between me and another worshipper, leaving a wide gap in front of them, and passed between us. I was a little annoyed and sighed within myself while the preacher was supplicating, and the preacher let out a sigh while supplicating; it was a sigh that had nothing to do with what he was saying, and he had never done it before, though I have been praying with him for almost a whole year .. I was surprised, but not much, because I am used to communication taking place between me and people at a distance .. And many people in the streets and public places show strange and unnatural states when I come near them or near the place where they stand .. So the matter is not very surprising to me .. Then after the supplication ended I said: Perhaps he will recite {Say: He is Allah, the One}, and I do not remember him reciting it before; and he did indeed recite it in the prayer .. Many people do not grasp such matters and think them superstitions .. In the context I have explained they are not superstitions and are possible, for souls are troops gathered together. But .. what matters is that no person to whom such things happen should carry them to the second level, which is the level of using this kind of spiritual connection, whose existence between him and others he discovers, in any misguided or wrong deed. Nor should he be deluded about himself, for people's connection with him is not a heroic feat he has performed or a merit by which he excels over people, but a solace for his soul and a meeting of his spirit with the spirits of people. So he should take the matter as part of the mercy of Allah the Exalted towards him, in that He brought his spirit together with the spirits of people in this way, so that the matter is not a trial for him or for others.""")

t(21, 1201, """If the one speaking to me were you, I would speak to you. But what can be done when the one speaking to me is Iblis, with your voice, with your mind and with your feeling? And Iblis is not to be spoken with!""")

t(21, 1600, """Wealth is only the wealth of Allah the Almighty, our Lord .. and human beings are the creation of Allah the Almighty, our Lord .. A person must work on earth as if he will live forever, and his knowledge of something of the unseen should not hold him back, because it is impossible for a person to encompass all of the unseen .. However much we think we have learned a great deal about the unseen, we will remain ignorant of much. If cities are built for people so that they may live as humans live, and they dwell in them for 10 years, then perish and are struck by extinction, a small bird that flees from a scorching sun or heavy rain into an empty building fulfils the reward, Allah willing, for those who built those houses! This world is a partnership between humans, animals, birds and others .. What a person leaves behind may afterwards be a rescue for a frightened animal or a relief for a bird looking for a nest for its young! This world is not for humans alone!

Hadith: “If the Hour comes while one of you has a seedling in his hand, then if he is able to plant it before it comes, let him plant it”
Summary of the hadith scholar's ruling: Its chain is authentic by the standard of Muslim""")

t(22, 984, """This is my inference of the shape of the region in the future and my inference of the new cities .. What do people need in their new cities? They will need a clean, decent home, new infrastructure, a large store that sells everything, work that brings a monthly income, free medical treatment and free basic services of life. There is no longer room to build cities of noise everywhere. Noise itself has many definitions: some of it is wrong, and we have seen over 100 years how it was; and some of it is not like what people lived through, but noise of another kind, like the gathering of all nationalities in one city (al-Quds). This adds an air of noise, because 150 nationalities, races and cultures at the least means 150 varied scenes from the scenes of life! The new cities of the future, whether in Egypt or in the countries of North Africa, Sudan, Yemen, Iraq and Sham, are cities of basic needs .. clean homes fit for humans, services, jobs, work and the life of plenty of which the Prophet ﷺ gave glad tidings .. As for noise, movement and vitality, I do not think they will be anywhere but in al-Quds, because the world's number one capital of political decision will attract all people. And wherever people gather as different races, life is different .. This does not mean that the great cities and their effect on the lives of their people will disappear .. But most of the neighbourhoods of the great cities are not fit for human living .. Perhaps people will abandon their worn-out neighbourhoods forever once they obtain the alternative. Perhaps they will turn into barracks for the armies!""")

t(23, 558, """Who said that wealth is more precious than the human being?! Allah the Exalted sends a person provision so that he may benefit from it, not so that he may hoard it. Caring for the human being is more important than hoarding wealth. A call to correct our ideas; may Allah the Exalted guide us all to the truth""")

t(23, 2062, """The new world .. The Arab region from the Ocean to the Gulf .. There is no crisis from which millions suffer today greater than the crisis of a home and housing fit for a human being""")
